{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0bfbc75d615a2cecf48f59390929509be33027166156568dcfb249a83a42a76e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_36207d4fb385d58573d7189c76950a98e8d223f28df27d7c4a50432c211272aa","slc_a35d1e1999e38ee962d1ed649f58ae74e710fd8d1d1889daa71cdba297196153"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"Anima is described as an open-source Agent OS for intelligent hardware, aiming to give home devices perceptive, decision-making, learning, and extensible AI capabilities rather than being a device control panel.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_247e5c7fedb850fedcfd3756826acdf3774a04afad92b0cd48c6470bd61e3a78","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_46c409be122d506ef880603e80764c195328a6fee2bf3d884b584b9c7228bcdd","slc_4b9a5c51566e7409dfb9b676b944673346ba874feded0c7eeaf596e028193148","slc_66b71c3ad7549ef084d2a78a9a9693fbb2569a2889d01bf26d9207d0ff1147d3","slc_76ce7283a3bde19501bc7c05c2c34e9baf1d70e987bd6151b4a0a9b9c8075bcb"],"source_ids":["src_b387f6512ee75993a72b3b3dcb570c73"],"text":"Repository development practice: AGENT.md and ARCHITECTURE_GUARDRAILS.md target coding agents contributing to the repo, defining module ownership boundaries, change heuristics, and testing expectations such as running tests under tests/ before considering work complete.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2af37671bd9d163d8a0142d3b9265e01aa97d55f4257982f064e9826f6831d29","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_aa180b9248ec6e73f541a9057ef786ccb07179fa8b9fff6b69e6ec46433a6316"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"Extracted memories use a schema with claim_type categories (explicit/implicit preferences, routines, aliases, constraints, home context), positive/negative evidence, and status values candidate/confirmed/rejected/stale; only confirmed memory enters skill decisions by default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3925c94946030187bae7ab5c4896b19dd9292b98494c8f077ef30b82c49e9296","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_10b44618fac72132d426f5531a6ed7f9915a6f7a6c12a59513004f5f5f1162e0","slc_9a07d48a6f75f1cb21cab690098e8e2eb50ce4894d1596fd2eebf57f381eedac"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859","src_caa814f5e98e550683e582e6aefa174b"],"text":"The runtime chain is device discovery, sensor/event updates, a rules fast path for safety, an LLM slow path, command execution via adapters, memory/history writes, and dashboard visibility.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3a845cbbe42e0dbab1b9910a112b73e90d5b4b8825b52114fe6bae39db771b91","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0cd1ba25b28f614db0a494a05bc35b9b1fe7ac1763a83079bb96681ee26d1872"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"The Brain is designed to decide within explicit skill boundaries, device capabilities, and safety rules rather than letting an LLM control devices freely.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3cc0c015e1d3d540c24426639c96a0e46790fe4e6630f6827b1389e96558072e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7f2574dd94b18ae5527294f79697f7130a2a99ab4c1e1ad64a3bb973c1c86d19","slc_dbbbfd20777876572941974b8d82e27caf6789f6bd78601a3cfadaa98147edb7"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"The backend exposes REST endpoints including /health, /api/devices, /api/chat, /api/environment, /api/scan, /api/memory, /api/settings, and Xiaomi QR login start/poll endpoints, with Swagger at localhost:8080/docs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4dd9ff3566948e4f7a033d05a2775970da5d48c66c8305cf750c4a48e8faa60a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_00376015f02a3442a94a5eecdffe1f9df539d70301d14ceed659287cb7fe0c4f","slc_e4675e8a62c956cb65bcca3d6613be9a1c52480420366fd7baa06d5a9a733a84"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"LLM integration is OpenAI-compatible, configured via ANIMA_LLM_API_KEY and optionally ANIMA_LLM_BASE_URL, supporting OpenAI, DeepSeek, Doubao, proxied Anthropic, and Ollama-compatible endpoints.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_78b9daea3331e0375dc183432c508859db32ba23556679864b75aa73a34b9cfd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1fa09c7a605c87120dbd8d2c787a1a8d957138da502606e4d61963462f6dc7f6","slc_5dcb2925051d488c8af7d7b0a1e2702bb0355a05fbffa9b01528247352b54f20","slc_907c5b09e695c708d23fc84903f234938db4414fbb5fce024fe0aeb0c11d05ce","slc_a83a0bf89721c22d20ee401d8a4ccde6fc76e29c18a9a5562b7fb99fb22b3ef1","slc_da25e6de42d8b1c8a6a30595559fe59d112f7420b2093dd038b369a1ad015ef6"],"source_ids":["src_b387f6512ee75993a72b3b3dcb570c73"],"text":"Per AGENT.md, MQTT is not the main production event path, the dashboard is polling-based rather than realtime, room modeling is weak, and chat is narrow task routing rather than a full assistant.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9b51c7b503d41e58c67777bcd68227a0a910dc0444c3b5a01c2658667ccae212","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5d67395b70c12eee6cc56c9e9b51966f08456c27910305fcb55461a3709191a6","slc_dd6480af61c73379006e4c5e7ce88f69187b1f1b9a0673629655cd5ab3158725"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"The stack is Python 3.11-3.13 with FastAPI and LangGraph plus a React dashboard; Docker Compose is the recommended deployment, requiring only Docker Desktop or Docker Engine with the Compose plugin.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9f7cebc7de082417d4e66dbf9851a0ded38ceeb64b50e8d3bc6fe47c09d7a1a9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d37e032fb8a8329b9f64d26b35fa927c7ad9506b5732c9564899e41f50febfe","slc_9f3972301e4687c16a5b2fb2a8115eb029bab84ac976a4a3c141575b9002c818","slc_ab10b23025da6f8b0e3ed541a043b6c9acaaac93984fadb93ebc3754e3acba65","slc_c393116fd8b924fc73f3efa2832665e90b8a86ae3c609a642444a9a9bdab51a7"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859","src_b387f6512ee75993a72b3b3dcb570c73"],"text":"The runtime comprises a Brain decision layer, device Skills, a layered Memory system, hardware Adapters, a FastAPI backend, and a React dashboard; core/main.py is the composition root and startup entrypoint.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c2a37ddc35ea3edae99c44735ac7b4ff4032d906d0b0f84365cbbbe71ca98a16","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_43474650649931feac451ed3be835a12442faaa3183528697a4e978addedef3b","slc_e1876d58aa89c32960f7ec806d2bea856b5a1f89c27796b8dcf13f42ca8d8537"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"Skills are device domain-knowledge packages with a defined layout: SKILL.md metadata, references (knowledge, decide, learn prompts), and scripts/actions.py as the structured action execution entrypoint.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cc9846b5244a7ee7f2c545ee5cbd6d77e0a722dc20dc5273b0368db3654620a8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_11b0a3e01159c46f0292bde226906a06a387cc57628d68027ffc4f48f5486f4f","slc_16b7674de93fc288860897d5f5ce862aa0a82a1806a862f9ec6c0f1bfaaee772","slc_3b6633bf9631663b90aa3ab29d756f03977988826c366db91f8fa038a6be7266"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"Memory is layered: L1 core identity loaded on every request, L2 a memory directory for the planner, and L3 detailed memories retrieved by device type and task before skill execution.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dcb6f79a76322ed93536504e7876c5d0492ef4b4c1679d92c37873c4674aca7d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_153c91b6bb5825363eba7f2c7b0a4795fb1d188a3e888f552abf3f0f4db7b33d"],"source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"text":"MIoT command execution depends on each device's reachable local IP and token; Xiaomi Cloud login is mainly for discovery and token acquisition, not universal cloud remote control.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e0d994ab5624ad8f9917691c96dba6bb59b93eb5e075f052efd887ed929297db","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"fullive-ai/anima@ea1542ff8420 snapshot 5a37690defbc92d2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5cff5c6ff7d795160283c4475709794a9c64d30c7363f445961c372b4e822341"],"source_ids":["src_b387f6512ee75993a72b3b3dcb570c73"],"text":"Per AGENT.md, the implemented system is a single-process Python backend under core/ with file-based memory in data/memory and a polling-based frontend refresh.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
